# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------#
# Document: .gitignore
# Description: Standard exclusion rules for Coozila! Studio. 
#              Note: 'apps/' is NOT ignored to allow Submodule tracking.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------#

# --- 🚀 CLONED APPLICATIONS (Submodules) ---
# We DO NOT ignore apps/ because we need to track Git Submodule pointers.
# However, we ignore potential local garbage inside those folders.
apps/*/venv/
apps/*/.env
apps/*/node_modules/

# --- 💾 PERSISTENT DATA & ASSETS (Large Files) ---
# We ignore the CONTENT of data/ to prevent committing 8K videos and audio.
data/coozila/outputs/*
data/coozila/sessions/*
data/coozila/exports/*
data/coozila/temp_assets/*

# Keep the directory structure but ignore files
!data/coozila/outputs/.gitkeep
!data/coozila/sessions/.gitkeep
!data/coozila/exports/.gitkeep

# Ignore any loose media files in root
*.mp4
*.gif
*.wav
*.mp3
*.log

# --- 🐍 PYTHON ENVIRONMENT ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env

# --- 🖥️ OS & IDE SPECIFIC ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/